---
id: org.dxos.plugin.messenger
name: MessengerPlugin
version: 0.1.0
---

Cross-space notifications for Composer. Contacts and bots send short messages through the HALO
inbox (signed envelopes relayed by EDGE); each recipient device stores them once in a feed in the
user's default space and lists them in a deck companion panel with an unread badge. Space
invitations are messages too: they render plugin-client's Join/Open surface and raise a toast on the
device that stored them. A message is an alert that points elsewhere — a short text and a link to
the object where the work lives — not a chat channel.

Design: `agents/superpowers/specs/2026-10-04-plugin-messenger-design.md`.

